<br>
---
<br>

''Pattern 1''
<br>
$cssDesc[Pattern 1 begins the painting activity by first picking an approach - easier to harder. The harder approaches are more chancy but does not requiring anything for entry.
<br>
The player can quit at any point, but it is not always so easy to do so.
<br>
Succeeding in successive rolls will take the player to a "boss fight" - a creative roadblock - overcoming which will create an opportunity to progress the story/painting.
<br>
Only the hard approach is implemented in this test, as the other approaches are not qualitatively different.]
<br>
($funcOutLink: "Begin pattern 1", "Begin painting.", "test.j.painting.1.pickApproach", [])

<br>
---
<br>

''Pattern 2''
<br>
$cssDesc[Pattern 2 is a vertical test of the most basic economic loop: painting -> restlessness -> fixation.
<br>
The purpose is to test variable chance.]
<br>
($funcOutLink: "Begin pattern 2", "Begin painting.", "test.j.painting.2.pickApproach", [])
